1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
[narrator] With the detonation
of Miniature Rose

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
activated by the stopping of his heart,

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Netero perished,

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
and when he died,
the King died along with him.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
[both wailing]

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,000
[opening theme music playing]

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

8
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,000
[singer singing in English]

9
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

10
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,000
[singer singing in English]

11
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

12
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,000
[flesh cracks]

13
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,000
[both gasp]

14
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,000
[sentimental music playing]

15
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,000
[gasps]

16
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,000
[gasps]

17
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,000
[Shaiapouf] He's breathing!

18
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:21,000
[Menthuthuyoupi]
We have to hurry! Damn it!

19
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,000
The King doesn't have long!

20
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,000
This is bad!

21
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:29,000
And there's not enough time
to get him back to Pitou!

22
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,000
[Shaiapouf] It's going to be fine.

23
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,000
I will save the King myself.

24
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,000
[gasps]

25
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:04,000
[sobbing]

26
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Hear me! Listen closely, my cells!

27
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:14,000
Go! Permeate the King, and heal him!

28
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:55,000
[dramatic music playing]

29
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,000
[both] Sire!

30
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,000
[Shaiapouf] Sire!

31
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,000
Are you all right?

32
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,000
How do you feel?

33
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:03,000
I am not worthy of praise
such as this, my King!

34
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:29,000
This is far too good.

35
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:34,000
And now that I have
experienced this taste,

36
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,000
I'll never, ever be able

37
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:42,000
to eat anything else but that in my life.

38
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:52,000
[Shaiapouf] Oh! Sire!

39
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:56,000
Sire! Oh, sire!

40
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Please, please, no more!

41
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,000
Oh, please, sire,

42
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:22,000
I sincerely hope
you'll be willing to accept this as well.

43
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,000
[Shaiapouf gasps]

44
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:26,000
[panting]

45
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:28,000
[orchestra music playing]

46
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,000
[grunts]

47
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:38,000
[grunts]

48
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,000
[dripping]

49
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:15,000
[Meruem straining]

50
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:28,000
[Meruem] What rich and powerful depth
of flavor.

51
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:33,000
This could only have come
from the heavens above,

52
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:37,000
these veritable dewdrops of the angels.

53
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,000
[groans]

54
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:46,000
[orchestra music playing]

55
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
Sire!

56
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:51,000
[wails] Sire!

57
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:54,000
Oh, sire!

58
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,000
[gasping]

59
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:06,000
[Meruem] Try as I might,
I cannot compare the two.

60
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:11,000
I will declare without hesitation

61
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:14,000
both of them are supreme dishes.

62
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:15,000
[gasps]

63
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,000
[sighs]

64
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:22,000
[Meruem] I need more, more of both.

65
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:25,000
Give me all that you have…

66
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:29,000
and I will receive it,

67
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,000
so give me more of it.

68
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:41,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] Sire!

69
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:44,000
[Shaiapouf] Sire!

70
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] Yes!

71
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,000
[Shaiapouf] Sire!

72
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,000
[both] With pleasure!

73
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:56,000
[narrator] This was supreme bliss

74
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,000
and unparalleled joy.

75
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,000
[Shaiapouf] What is this?

76
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,000
[imperceptible]

77
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] What's this feeling?

78
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:37,000
From this point on, always,

79
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:41,000
you will refer to me as Meruem.

80
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:43,000
[both gasp]

81
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:52,000
[Meruem] For you see, that name…

82
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:55,000
is the name my mother gave me.

83
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:59,000
[chorus vocalizing]

84
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,000
[Shaiapouf gasping]

85
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:28,000
[chorus continues]

86
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:37,000
[narrator] By facing the King's
near-death and revival

87
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:41,000
and sharing the essence
of their own being,

88
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:45,000
Pouf and Youpi
underwent a transformation…

89
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:49,000
and became equals to the Queen,

90
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:53,000
the mother of their species.

91
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:04,000
[wind rushing]

92
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,000
[sinister music playing]

93
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:31,000
[suspense music playing]

94
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:38,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] It's clear
that his strength has increased.

95
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] The King's heartbeat,

96
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,000
his warmth.

97
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:59,000
We're even able to share
in the King's thoughts.

98
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:40,000
Maybe we should go back
to the palace first, sire.

99
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:45,000
If you still wish to feed,

100
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:47,000
there is more than enough to satisfy you.

101
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:55,000
[Meruem] "Feed"?

102
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:58,000
Oh, I see.

103
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:01,000
[dramatic music playing]

104
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:03,000
That taste was real after all.

105
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,000
[both gasp]

106
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:11,000
[Meruem] Even as I wandered
through the waning light,

107
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,000
I heard someone call my name.

108
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:18,000
"Meruem," they said.

109
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:22,000
-[wind blowing]
-[both gasp]

110
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:33,000
And now,

111
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,000
I cannot remember why I'm here.

112
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:50,000
Lord Meruem.

113
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:01,000
In fact, I am absolutely
overflowing with raw energy.

114
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:08,000
My mind, however, is clouded in fog.

115
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,000
[gasps]

116
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:15,000
Tell me, why do you look like that?

117
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,000
[gasps]

118
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:20,000
[shudders]

119
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:28,000
and will dispose…

120
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:30,000
-[gasps]
-[Menthuthuyoupi gasps]

121
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:37,000
Do you understand?

122
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:40,000
It makes no difference to me
if you do it out of affection.

123
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,000
Lying to me is a breach of trust.

124
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:52,000
So I did eat you.

125
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:55,000
I ate both of you.

126
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:59,000
We offered ourselves to you freely!

127
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,000
We know we stepped
way out of line, sire,

128
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,000
but it's what we really wanted.

129
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:09,000
[Meruem] Well, what happened?

130
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,000
Explain yourselves.

131
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:13,000
Before we do,

132
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:15,000
I'm afraid that I must
ask you a question.

133
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:18,000
It appears that you are able to recall

134
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:45,000
Perhaps, I should say instead
that I remembered them,

135
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,000
My Lord Meruem…

136
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:56,000
I think that you may be suffering

137
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:13,000
However, the human,
a coward and a scoundrel,

138
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:16,000
resorted to a devious,
underhanded trick

139
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:19,000
and utilized a powerful bomb,
betraying your good faith.

140
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:28,000
[Meruem] A duel. Yes, that's right.

141
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,000
I remember it now.

142
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:44,000
to kill you, sire.

143
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:47,000
However, none of us could bear

144
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:04,000
No, they belong entirely to you.

145
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:08,000
We merely returned
what was already yours

146
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:19,000
That will be the fastest way
for you to regain your memory.

147
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,000
[Shaiapouf] Well, well.

148
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:28,000
This… This is a golden opportunity!

149
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:34,000
If I return to the palace first…

150
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,000
He'll never even remember
who she was.

151
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:57,000
This will require convincing Pitou

152
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:59,000
and getting rid of that meddling human.

153
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:03,000
No, I know what I must do.

154
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:09,000
Before all else, I must end its life.

155
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:21,000
If he's running at full speed,
the King will still need 20 minutes

156
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:23,000
to reach the palace.

157
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:27,000
Oh, that's more than enough time
to kill her.

158
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:48,000
[gasps]

159
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:49,000
I can already fly.

160
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:58,000
-[Shaiapouf gasps]
-[Menthuthuyoupi laughs]

161
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,000
[Meruem] Which way to the palace?

162
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:03,000
North, sire.

163
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,000
You should be able to make it there

164
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:06,000
in about 15 minutes or so if you hurry up.

165
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:10,000
[wind blowing]

166
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:17,000
It's there.

167
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:28,000
[suspense music playing]

168
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:46,000
[Shaiapouf] He's fast.

169
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:49,000
I can't slow down, or he'll catch up!

170
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:58,000
Quickly! Quickly, my segments!

171
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,000
This is a gamble.

172
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:05,000
It won't be long before the King sees

173
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:08,000
the millions of humans
gathered outside the palace.

174
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:11,000
Then he'll remember everything.

175
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:47,000
[Knuckle] Hakoware!

176
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:01,000
[Palm] I've seen you
with my eye before…

177
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:09,000
before I was turned into a cocoon.

178
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:17,000
That means I'll always be able to see you,
no matter where you go.

179
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:21,000
WINK BLUE:
LONESOME DEEP SEA FISH

180
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,000
[Shaiapouf] What was that?

181
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:25,000
It felt like something
just attacked my segment.

182
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:30,000
Whatever it was, it came from nowhere.

183
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:37,000
I don't know.

184
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:41,000
It seems to have resulted
from the remaining enemies

185
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:56,000
It's the King.

186
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:08,000
The King is alive!

187
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:09,000
[closing theme music playing]

188
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:12,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

189
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:31,000
[upbeat music playing]

190
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:34,000
[Gon] Next time,
"Formidable Enemy and Clear Objective."

191
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:36,000
Know how people say, "like," a lot?

192
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:38,000
-[Killua] Sure.
-[Gon] So, like, do I say,

193
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:40,000
"Formidable, like,
Enemy and Clear, like--"

194
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:42,000
[Killua] Well, uh…

195
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:46,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
